		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7A63B9D1F4FD1511"]
			description: ["In the nucleus's photon bath a target is cracked into a mix of rare isotopes; the stellar forge then burns the mix into p-process plasma. The forge on its tether, and a calutron's enriched targets from home. Plasmas for stage III's tree. Targets in, isotopes out, and the light is free."]
			icon: "gtceu:photonuclear_mix_bucket"
