		{
			dependencies: ["1840CCD84935F2C6"]
			description: ["A diamond grown in the dark has no flaws to speak of. The fab grows it on a seed plate cut at home from older stock. The lattice fab at home for the plate, and the void crystal fab here. The engineered lattice, and with it the end of the stage. Seed plates travel by chest; the fab does the rest."]
